---
const snapshots = [
  { x: 222, y: 130, a: 0 },
  { x: 150, y: 58, a: 180 },
  { x: 78, y: 130, a: 360 },
  { x: 150, y: 202, a: 540 },
]
---

<figure class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-2 border-ink p-4 sm:p-6">
  <p class="font-bold">
    Watch the centre of the rolling coin, not just the edge of the fixed one.
  </p>
  <svg
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm"
    viewBox="0 0 300 260"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="coin-rotation-title coin-rotation-desc"
  >
    <title id="coin-rotation-title">A coin rolling around an equal coin</title>
    <desc id="coin-rotation-desc">
      The centre of the moving coin follows a circle of twice the radius of either coin. One
      full orbit rotates the moving coin twice.
    </desc>
    <circle
      cx="150"
      cy="130"
      r="72"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
      stroke-dasharray="7 6"
      fill="none"
      opacity=".4"
    />
    <circle
      cx="150"
      cy="130"
      r="36"
      fill="#d7a13d"
      fill-opacity=".45"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
    />
    <text x="150" y="136" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">
      Fixed
    </text>
    {snapshots.map(({ x, y, a }, i) => (
      <g>
        <circle
          cx={x}
          cy={y}
          r="36"
          fill="#387a91"
          fill-opacity=".16"
          stroke="#387a91"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-dasharray={i === 0 ? undefined : "5 5"}
        />
        <g transform={`translate(${x} ${y}) rotate(${a})`}>
          <path d="M0 0 V-28" stroke="#bd4b37" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle r="4" fill="#bd4b37" />
        </g>
      </g>
    ))}
    <g fill="currentColor" font-size="16">
      <text x="8" y="22">
        Each coin: r
      </text>
      <text x="8" y="44">
        Orbit: 2r
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-base">
    <div class="border border-ink p-3">
      <strong>Moving coin circumference</strong>
      <p>2πr</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-ink p-3">
      <strong>Path of its centre</strong>
      <p>4πr</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="text-base leading-normal">
    The rolling coin travels two of its own circumferences on the path taken by its centre: 4πr
    ÷ 2πr = <strong>2 turns</strong>. The four outlines are snapshots, not four different moving
    coins.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
